1
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:10,370
Transaction Blotter lists every deal: account, order, ticket, instrument, lot, side and rate.

2
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:20,560
Day or Shift sets the period. Refresh loads the newest deals, and Filters narrows the list.

3
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:28,140
Reopened (Trading) lists the positions carried over from earlier days, on the trading side.

4
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:35,710
Reopened (Clearing) does the same for the clearing side.

5
00:00:35,810 --> 00:00:43,290
Trading M2M marks the book to market: offset and market-maker profit for each instrument, with the total on top.

6
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:50,870
Clearing M2M is the same view for the clearing side.

7
00:00:50,970 --> 00:00:55,580
Overall Info adds both views up per instrument.

8
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:59,700
Each view has its own search.

9
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:02,700
Day and Shift are also on the bottom bar.

